                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">e.g., enter 13.25 for 13.25%.</p>
                </div>

                <hr class="my-6 border-indigo-200">
                <h3 class="text-md font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-2">Fixed Per-Order Fee Settings (Based on Total Sale)</h3>

                <!-- Input Group: Fixed Fee Threshold -->
